          "source_bid": "d59f2ofs2u4h",
          "details": "明年，擢拜橫海軍節度使，賜姓李氏，名全略，以崇樹之。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hixi5vx2iuj0",
      "text": "代州刺史",
      "place_id": "hixicabuemg5",
      "sources": [
